    "fullCleanText": "Hello, is this the Greenfield Walking Club?\nYes, it is. I’m Leo, the treasurer.\nGreat. I’d like to join the Saturday walk. What is the cost?\nThe fee is £12, including tea, or £15 if you want the bus ticket.\nShould I bring a map?\nNo, we lend maps. But do wear strong shoes because the path is muddy after rain.\nWhere do we meet?\nWe meet outside the old library gate at nine o’clock sharp. Please arrive ten minutes early so everyone can sign in quickly. The group leaves promptly at nine, and nobody waits for latecomers, because the bus has to reach the trailhead before the morning traffic builds up.\nUnderstood. Thank you."
